Package: stanviz
Title: Plotting Helpers for Stan Models
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Metodi", "Latinov",
           email = "your-email@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reusable ggplot2-based plotting functions for fitted Stan models,
    covering prior and posterior predictive checks, MCMC diagnostics,
    parameter posteriors, conditional effects, mediation decomposition,
    prior sensitivity, and PSIS-LOO model comparison.
